Looking at this problem, I need to find all integer pairs $(a,b)$ such that $(x^2+ax+b) \cdot P(x)$ has all non-leading coefficients in $\{+1,-1\}$.

**Answer leak check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions. Proceeding.

